WEBVTT

00:06.140 --> 00:07.770
Hey, Abel?

00:08.360 --> 00:10.900
Are you really sure you 
don't have to get back?

00:10.900 --> 00:13.760
Even if a large church likely 
has a few clergy to it,

00:13.760 --> 00:15.400
there must be work for you, right?

00:15.400 --> 00:18.660
The place isn't <i>that</i> full of work.

00:18.660 --> 00:22.410
I'd say I was more busy with other work.

00:23.100 --> 00:24.920
"Other work"?

00:29.990 --> 00:31.850
Did someone come to pray?

00:31.850 --> 00:33.150
Could you go open the door for them?

00:33.150 --> 00:35.800
Sure thing. Oof.

00:38.450 --> 00:40.800
The door is unlocked...?

00:43.400 --> 00:45.520
Hey! What're you doing?

00:45.520 --> 00:46.990
Hurry up and open the—

00:46.990 --> 00:48.960
Slamming the door as soon 
as you see a person's face?

00:48.960 --> 00:50.560
How rude can you be?

00:53.570 --> 00:55.030
The door is...

02:28.290 --> 02:32.000
Episode 4

02:28.290 --> 02:32.000
She Who Is Called the Lady Saint

02:32.360 --> 02:34.400
My deepest apologies.

02:34.400 --> 02:37.500
Confronted with the unexpected, 
I reacted violently without thinking.

02:37.660 --> 02:39.270
I will compensate you.

02:39.270 --> 02:41.880
May I ask you to delay dealing 
with this matter until that time?

02:41.880 --> 02:44.520
I'm sure that the metal fittings 
had gotten old, that's all.

02:44.520 --> 02:48.520
This is an incredible blunder on my part.

02:46.010 --> 02:48.520
<i>She isn't from this village.</i>

02:48.520 --> 02:52.570
Have you come all the way here 
to meet with the lady saint?

02:52.570 --> 02:54.440
No, I haven't.

02:54.440 --> 02:56.530
The person I have business 
with is over there, sleeping.

02:56.530 --> 02:58.840
I'm here for Abel.

02:58.840 --> 03:00.520
What? For Abel?

03:01.430 --> 03:04.960
Honestly, making me of all 
people go searching for him.

03:04.960 --> 03:07.440
After abandoning his work as a home tutor,

03:07.440 --> 03:09.080
what has he been doing with himself?

03:09.080 --> 03:11.200
<i>"Home tutor"?</i>

03:11.480 --> 03:12.410
Hey!

03:12.410 --> 03:13.780
You're awake, aren't you?

03:13.780 --> 03:16.630
This method of waking me up will likely have 
an effect on my hair cuticles.

03:16.630 --> 03:19.970
You perpetually got failing marks. 
Is it really true you're a home tutor?

03:19.970 --> 03:22.720
I managed to graduate just fine, you know?

03:22.720 --> 03:24.920
And who is this person?

03:24.920 --> 03:27.630
She's well-dressed, so she must be from
 a family of high standing, right?

03:27.630 --> 03:31.570
The place I live, from here 
I guess it'd be the town to the west,

03:31.570 --> 03:33.190
it's a big city, right?

03:33.190 --> 03:35.830
It's crawling with distinguished families.

03:35.830 --> 03:38.070
<i>So, she's a well-bred young lady.</i>

03:38.800 --> 03:40.540
I'm sorry for not introducing myself.

03:40.540 --> 03:43.770
My name is Hazelita Aldridge.

03:43.770 --> 03:45.590
As I mentioned earlier,

03:45.590 --> 03:48.320
I've come to ascertain 
this one's whereabouts.

03:48.320 --> 03:50.200
Is pulling my hair a fad right now?

03:50.200 --> 03:51.690
And you!

03:51.690 --> 03:54.080
You could respond to a letter, couldn't you?

03:54.080 --> 03:55.790
Did I get a letter?

03:57.160 --> 04:00.120
Because of that, I've had to 
come all the way out here and...

03:58.120 --> 03:59.540
That letter...

04:00.420 --> 04:01.680
Excuse me.

04:02.430 --> 04:06.050
I'm a representative of this church. 
My name is Lawrence.

04:06.250 --> 04:09.040
I see. So, you're...

04:10.320 --> 04:14.050
I heard that this church has 
a lady saint staying here.

04:14.050 --> 04:14.970
Yes.

04:14.970 --> 04:19.220
Right now, I believe she's searching 
for four-leaf clovers.

04:19.220 --> 04:20.320
Four-leaf...

04:20.770 --> 04:22.120
Lawren!

04:22.120 --> 04:23.780
Speaking of which...

04:25.880 --> 04:27.280
What's this?

04:27.280 --> 04:28.430
You're...

04:28.430 --> 04:30.280
So, you really are the one from before!

04:30.920 --> 04:33.360
I am called Cecilia, the lady saint.

04:33.360 --> 04:35.360
We meet again.

04:35.360 --> 04:38.970
You seemed more absentminded back then, 
so I never imagined you were the lady saint.

04:38.970 --> 04:41.550
I promise it isn't a lie!

04:41.550 --> 04:44.870
Miss, have you met Saint Cecilia before?

04:44.870 --> 04:45.800
Yes,

04:45.800 --> 04:49.040
in town, when she nearly 
fell down some stairs.

04:49.490 --> 04:50.970
Really?

04:51.800 --> 04:55.310
So, Saint Cecilia, did you 
find any four-leaf clovers?

04:55.310 --> 04:59.480
There weren't any four-leaf clovers, 
but there were a lot of flowers blooming!

04:59.480 --> 05:02.800
So, I decided to try making a flower crown.

05:02.800 --> 05:05.320
Lady Saint, you can do things like that?

05:05.320 --> 05:07.570
I learned how when I was little.

05:07.570 --> 05:10.780
But I've mostly forgotten how.

05:10.780 --> 05:11.880
I thought you would surely—

05:11.880 --> 05:13.990
No, I really don't know how.

05:13.990 --> 05:17.710
The miss here would know, right? 
How to make a flower crown.

05:24.500 --> 05:26.590
If you go like this here...

05:27.190 --> 05:29.210
That's incredible, Hazelita!

05:29.480 --> 05:31.420
Perhaps this can be an opportunity for

05:31.420 --> 05:33.990
you to learn how to make 
a flower crown, Lawren.

05:33.990 --> 05:36.760
I won't ever have any reason 
to make any, so...

05:36.760 --> 05:39.850
I thought it might be fun 
to make them together.

05:39.850 --> 05:43.350
If I joined you, I'd be so out of place.

05:43.680 --> 05:47.030
So, you're a person who
won't grant a girl's request, then.

05:47.030 --> 05:49.030
I, um...

05:49.030 --> 05:52.400
Say, miss, did you bring 
any gifts for me?

05:52.400 --> 05:54.770
How insolent! Yes, I did!

05:54.770 --> 05:56.080
You did, huh?

05:58.080 --> 06:02.320
So, Abel was the person you 
were looking for?

06:02.320 --> 06:05.400
Well, since I was already here to fetch Abel back,

06:05.400 --> 06:08.920
I did plan to see the lady saint 
who lived here at the church.

06:08.920 --> 06:12.680
A lady saint is a rarity for most people,

06:12.680 --> 06:16.610
so a lot of people come to catch 
a glimpse of her, as you did, Miss Hazelita.

06:16.610 --> 06:17.850
Really?

06:18.080 --> 06:20.610
In this area, those 
who are called lady saints,

06:20.610 --> 06:24.320
including the Great Lady Saint 
and myself, number very few.

06:24.580 --> 06:30.310
The Great Lady Saint lives on Michela Island 
in the bay, so it's difficult to visit her.

06:30.310 --> 06:34.450
And there aren't many occasions to meet 
with the Great Lady Saint in the first place.

06:34.450 --> 06:37.090
Since we lady saints blend 
into the daily lives

06:37.090 --> 06:39.520
of the people, we're easier to meet with.

06:40.140 --> 06:41.670
Now that I think about it,

06:41.670 --> 06:46.410
I thought I'd heard that there was 
a lady saint in the town to the west.

06:46.410 --> 06:47.970
Lawrence.

06:47.970 --> 06:50.470
Miss seems to be tired 
from her long journey.

06:50.470 --> 06:52.560
Would it be all right 
to let her stay here tonight?

06:52.560 --> 06:54.370
That's very sudden.

06:54.370 --> 06:56.220
Wait. Abel?

06:56.790 --> 06:58.050
Please?

06:59.680 --> 07:01.000
All right.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.690
Please use this room.

07:11.920 --> 07:14.050
If you need anything, please tell me.

07:17.960 --> 07:20.500
I'm not particularly tired, though.

07:28.520 --> 07:30.210
A flower crown.

07:30.920 --> 07:34.710
Have I ever made one 
for anyone other than her?

07:35.350 --> 07:36.710
Hazelita!

07:39.750 --> 07:44.600
You've really gotten so good 
at making flower crowns!

07:44.600 --> 07:47.900
Mine broke while I was still making it.

07:47.900 --> 07:50.530
I-If you stick it back together, 
it could still work!

07:50.530 --> 07:54.540
I'll finish making that one, 
so you wear this one, Lady Saint!

07:55.950 --> 07:58.650
Thank you, Hazelita.

07:59.280 --> 08:01.610
You are a very kind girl, aren't you?

08:07.820 --> 08:09.110
Lady Saint!

08:09.110 --> 08:10.170
Hazelita!

08:10.170 --> 08:11.260
Older brother!

08:11.260 --> 08:12.840
The lady saint is in pain!

08:12.840 --> 08:14.800
We must have a doctor see to her quickly!

08:15.200 --> 08:18.120
Why isn't anyone worried for her?

08:18.120 --> 08:19.800
The lady saint could die!

08:19.800 --> 08:21.400
Older brother!

08:21.400 --> 08:23.320
Young lady of the Aldridge family?

08:24.060 --> 08:26.070
What are you talking about?

08:26.360 --> 08:28.730
She is a lady saint.

08:28.730 --> 08:32.430
It would be presumptuous 
to treat her like us normal humans.

08:33.280 --> 08:36.000
They come and stand among 
us in order to save people,

08:36.000 --> 08:38.530
and they are closer to God 
than anyone else could be.

08:39.090 --> 08:42.040
How could they possibly fall ill?

08:50.540 --> 08:53.270
All the people charged 
with managing lady saints...

08:53.620 --> 08:58.160
they're all blinded by greed 
and the need for renown.

08:58.160 --> 09:00.160
The lady saint here, too...

09:02.180 --> 09:04.230
I'm sorry to disturb you 
while you're resting.

09:04.230 --> 09:06.430
It's about dinner tonight.

09:06.930 --> 09:07.930
Um...

09:10.880 --> 09:13.690
The pallor of your face... 
Are you all right?

09:13.690 --> 09:15.120
Where is the lady saint?

09:15.120 --> 09:17.580
She's downstairs with Abel.

09:17.580 --> 09:18.490
I see.

09:18.920 --> 09:23.580
You are the person I most 
wanted to ask something.

09:24.660 --> 09:29.040
What do you think of the lady saint 
that you live with her like this?

09:29.040 --> 09:30.080
What?

09:30.080 --> 09:31.650
You must think something, right?

09:31.650 --> 09:32.730
For example,

09:32.730 --> 09:35.960
perhaps you think that the lady 
saint's presence will benefit you.

09:37.000 --> 09:40.980
Well, it's true that 
there are some benefits.

09:41.420 --> 09:45.980
Before the lady saint came, 
I lived here alone.

09:46.230 --> 09:49.980
So, there are things like, 
now I don't have to feel lonely while I eat!

09:49.980 --> 09:50.880
What?

09:51.520 --> 09:54.250
Cooking is a hobby of mine,

09:54.250 --> 09:57.840
so having someone around who eats 
so enthusiastically really is a benefit.

09:57.840 --> 09:59.070
No, no!

09:59.070 --> 10:01.530
That isn't the sort of benefit I meant!

10:01.530 --> 10:04.280
I meant using the lady saint 
to increase your income...

10:04.550 --> 10:09.750
or using the excuse that she's God's 
messenger to make her keep working.

10:10.290 --> 10:13.290
I've heard stories like that.

10:13.800 --> 10:15.000
But...

10:15.290 --> 10:19.160
the first thing I felt when I first saw 
the Lady Saint was...

10:19.160 --> 10:23.510
"This is someone I must treasure dearly."

10:23.510 --> 10:27.970
I want the lady saint to always be smiling.

10:29.500 --> 10:35.820
If I make a flower crown 
for the Lady Saint, I wonder if she'll smile.

10:36.360 --> 10:39.160
<i>It's just like back then.</i>

10:39.980 --> 10:43.240
I see. I understand now.

10:43.480 --> 10:46.420
I apologize for suddenly 
asking something so strange.

10:46.420 --> 10:48.520
She's very important to you, isn't she?

10:48.520 --> 10:51.400
Yes, she is a very dear roommate.

10:51.400 --> 10:52.530
"Roommate"?

10:52.530 --> 10:53.700
Yes.

10:55.250 --> 10:57.760
Realizes
something.

10:57.760 --> 11:00.250
You did that on purpose, didn't you, Abel?

11:00.250 --> 11:01.580
Did what?

11:01.580 --> 11:06.560
Arranged things so that Hazelita 
would come here and meet Lawren.

11:07.690 --> 11:11.300
You can tell just from looking at Hazelita 
that she carries something with her.

11:11.300 --> 11:16.820
It has something to do with the lady saint 
in the town to the west that Lawren mentioned.

11:17.080 --> 11:20.570
<i>I suppose Saint Cecilia 
would be able to see it.</i>

11:20.570 --> 11:22.270
Saint Cecilia,

11:22.270 --> 11:26.080
have you heard stories from 
that town about the Lady Saint of Compassion?

11:26.800 --> 11:30.970
The people around her treated 
her like she transcended humanity.

11:30.970 --> 11:34.480
She died of a disease that could 
have been cured if she'd seen a doctor.

11:34.480 --> 11:38.590
In other words, lady saints are just humans.

11:38.880 --> 11:41.640
She was the lady's friend.

11:41.880 --> 11:43.640
Her friend?

11:43.640 --> 11:46.820
Because of those events, 
her prejudices have grown too strong,

11:46.820 --> 11:50.320
which is why she's wary of 
Lawrence, who lives with you.

11:50.320 --> 11:56.500
So, you thought that if Hazelita came here, 
something might change?

11:56.500 --> 11:59.360
Such feelings of sadness won't be easy to...

11:59.360 --> 12:02.490
It's more than enough just 
to have her see this.

12:02.490 --> 12:04.200
Even just observing from the outside,

12:04.200 --> 12:08.600
it's clear that you and Lawrence care 
for each other very much.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.490
What?

12:09.490 --> 12:14.230
But it would be nice if he treated 
you more like a regular girl, right?

12:16.130 --> 12:20.010
Such a fluffy bed.

12:20.010 --> 12:24.010
Shiny, smooth cuticles.

12:20.310 --> 12:24.000
Sleek and shiny. Sleek and shiny.

12:31.390 --> 12:32.910
It's delicious.

12:32.910 --> 12:34.020
Isn't it?!

12:34.020 --> 12:35.620
It's delectable, isn't it?

12:35.620 --> 12:38.020
You're being very insistent.

12:38.320 --> 12:41.480
I'm sorry to make you serve me such a feast.

12:41.480 --> 12:42.420
Not at all.

12:42.420 --> 12:45.440
I'm glad you aren't picky 
about your food, Miss Hazelita.

12:45.440 --> 12:49.610
If I were, I wouldn't be 
able to go to people's parties.

12:49.880 --> 12:52.600
Though, a certain someone 
who has accompanied me more than once...

12:52.600 --> 12:55.060
has found things he was unable to eat.

12:55.060 --> 12:57.930
I mean, if the carrots 
are cooked, I can't eat them.

12:57.930 --> 12:59.160
They're too sweet.

12:59.160 --> 13:00.430
Honestly.

13:00.430 --> 13:03.360
This, when the Lady Saint 
eats anything we give her.

13:03.360 --> 13:05.880
You say "anything," and it's true,

13:05.880 --> 13:09.880
but everything you make 
for me is delicious, Lawren.

13:09.880 --> 13:12.320
There isn't any way 
for me to come to hate anything!

13:12.320 --> 13:14.200
What? Oh, yes.

13:14.200 --> 13:18.540
Scones, madeleines, cookies, 
they're all delicious!

13:16.060 --> 13:19.540
<i>The lady saint is so 
overflowing with affection.</i>

13:18.540 --> 13:21.370
Please don't raise the bar so high!

13:19.540 --> 13:22.620
<i>It isn't likely that she's 
being treated horribly, right?</i>

13:22.050 --> 13:24.320
I'm only telling the truth! And also...

13:23.210 --> 13:25.480
<i>I've been very blind.</i>

13:27.860 --> 13:29.240
Then, it's true?

13:29.240 --> 13:32.310
Normally, the two of you 
live here on your own?

13:32.310 --> 13:33.690
Yes, that's right.

13:33.690 --> 13:36.410
You and a man you're not related to, alone?

13:39.560 --> 13:42.600
And anything could happen, is that it?

13:42.600 --> 13:44.050
Oh dear, Miss.

13:44.050 --> 13:46.150
I didn't mean to imply anything like that!

13:46.150 --> 13:48.920
The truth is that nothing happens.

13:49.240 --> 13:52.840
Living with a girl this beautiful 
and nothing happens?

13:52.840 --> 13:54.940
Is there something wrong with him?

13:54.940 --> 13:57.480
Miss, do try to soften the blow a little.

13:58.710 --> 14:02.600
It's already been more than a year 
since we started living together.

14:02.600 --> 14:04.620
I'm so sorry.

14:05.870 --> 14:07.980
Who made the lady saint cry?!

14:07.980 --> 14:08.870
You did!

14:08.870 --> 14:09.320
Huh?

14:09.320 --> 14:10.480
It was you!

14:10.480 --> 14:11.240
What?

14:12.370 --> 14:14.470
You've really had a hard time of it.

14:14.470 --> 14:17.750
Um... Lady Saint?

14:18.720 --> 14:21.110
Please call me Cecilia.

14:21.110 --> 14:23.440
It's easier to say, isn't it?

14:24.760 --> 14:26.830
Ce... Ceci...

14:27.330 --> 14:29.510
Don't laugh!

14:29.510 --> 14:31.810
Now, now. The fact 
that you're trying to call

14:31.810 --> 14:33.920
her that is probably good enough, Miss.

14:34.410 --> 14:36.520
<i>I-It can't be...</i>

14:37.100 --> 14:38.770
That's just cruel!

14:38.770 --> 14:40.720
Why is everyone being like this with me?

14:40.720 --> 14:44.780
It's because you're so dense about stuff 
that has to do with you, Lawrence.

14:44.780 --> 14:47.100
You got good scores on tests, though.

14:47.100 --> 14:51.280
And you can achieve anything you want to, 
but you only ever slack off.

14:51.690 --> 14:55.040
That's right! Do your job as a home tutor!

14:55.040 --> 14:56.240
But...

14:56.240 --> 14:58.120
No buts.

14:58.120 --> 15:00.120
I'll go get everything you'll need.

15:00.120 --> 15:01.640
Fine...

15:05.270 --> 15:08.380
Hasn't that one been a bother 
while he's been here?

15:08.380 --> 15:10.590
No, not at all!

15:10.590 --> 15:15.080
The two of you living together must come 
with problems sometimes.

15:15.080 --> 15:18.600
If anything happens, 
you can talk to me any time.

15:19.570 --> 15:20.910
Cecilia.

15:22.770 --> 15:25.500
It would be nice if 
the day came when someone

15:25.500 --> 15:28.350
other than me called you that, wouldn't it?

15:28.350 --> 15:30.690
Um... Yes.

15:30.690 --> 15:32.780
All the preparations are complete.

15:32.780 --> 15:34.300
Thank you.

15:36.220 --> 15:40.370
Now then, why are you 
so lacking in enthusiasm?

15:41.330 --> 15:44.970
I mean, if Lawrence 
taught you instead of me,

15:44.970 --> 15:47.630
you'd probably learn a lot more, right?

15:47.940 --> 15:49.880
What are you talking about?

15:50.120 --> 15:54.100
This is something you must do, 
not someone else.

15:54.100 --> 15:58.640
If you hold back just because others excel, 
what will that accomplish?

15:58.640 --> 16:01.860
You are the one I asked to do this work.

16:04.400 --> 16:07.120
You are just as dazzling as ever.

16:07.490 --> 16:08.500
What?

16:08.500 --> 16:09.670
Nothing.

16:09.670 --> 16:13.740
Just that when my young miss walks her own 
path she looks very impressive, that's all.

16:14.530 --> 16:16.190
You're making fun of me, aren't you?!

16:16.190 --> 16:18.150
I'm not. Really.

16:18.150 --> 16:20.090
I do think you're funny though.

16:20.090 --> 16:21.160
Hey!

16:21.160 --> 16:22.880
You've grown even more 
discourteous, haven't you?

16:22.880 --> 16:23.960
How rude.

16:23.960 --> 16:25.730
I haven't even begun to try for real yet.

16:24.500 --> 16:26.820
Things sound lively, don't they?

16:25.730 --> 16:26.810
What did you say?

16:26.820 --> 16:29.200
It's nice that they have so much energy.

16:29.200 --> 16:30.550
I suppose.

16:30.880 --> 16:32.810
<i>Back then Miss Hazelita was...</i>

16:33.370 --> 16:35.140
<i>She seemed like she was suffering.</i>

16:36.120 --> 16:38.200
<i>The lady saint of the town to the west.</i>

16:38.200 --> 16:42.680
<i>About ten years ago, Grandpa 
was lamenting that she had died, right?</i>

16:42.940 --> 16:48.700
<i>He must have seen a lot of paths 
that the lady saint here never had to tread.</i>

16:48.700 --> 16:49.900
Lawren?

16:52.380 --> 16:53.970
Are you tired?

16:53.970 --> 16:54.920
No.

16:54.920 --> 16:57.580
I was just thinking about 
how much has happened today.

16:57.940 --> 16:59.930
Now that I think about it, Lady Saint,

16:59.930 --> 17:02.080
your posture has been very good today.

17:02.370 --> 17:03.580
<b>Twitch</b>

17:03.280 --> 17:06.830
That's because I... I felt 
I had to behave properly.

17:07.770 --> 17:11.090
So you've been being considerate 
in your way, haven't you, Lady Saint?

17:11.090 --> 17:15.000
But right now, look! You can loll 
about like you usually do!

17:17.050 --> 17:20.430
L-Like this?

17:20.430 --> 17:21.890
That seems rather awkward.

17:21.890 --> 17:24.890
When I'm told to do it, it's a little...

17:28.140 --> 17:32.570
Lawren, you always respect me 
as a person, don't you?

17:32.840 --> 17:35.480
I heard what happened to Hazelita.

17:35.760 --> 17:38.830
It was a sad, lonely sort of story.

17:39.100 --> 17:41.820
Which made me realize it once again.

17:42.160 --> 17:46.110
Thank you for always 
treating me with such care.

17:47.120 --> 17:48.660
The pleasure is mine.

17:48.660 --> 17:52.000
Thank you for allowing me to look after you.

17:53.490 --> 17:56.290
<i>Though, I'm looking after you, too!</i>

17:57.130 --> 18:01.010
The morning starts deliciously!

18:01.010 --> 18:05.020
They finished everything with delight.

18:05.710 --> 18:08.280
Pastor Abel, see you later!

18:08.280 --> 18:10.840
Watch your step, all right?

18:13.480 --> 18:14.280
And...

18:15.320 --> 18:16.670
just what are you doing?

18:16.670 --> 18:21.040
I was investigating to see whether there 
were any suspicious persons after Cecilia!

18:21.040 --> 18:22.920
You're the suspicious one here.

18:22.920 --> 18:25.200
Now that your misunderstanding 
about Lawrence has been fixed,

18:25.200 --> 18:26.700
everything's fine, isn't it?

18:26.700 --> 18:29.250
I suppose you could call 
that a misunderstanding,

18:29.250 --> 18:32.460
but I need to become much 
more level-headed, don't I?

18:32.910 --> 18:34.160
Hup.

18:34.160 --> 18:37.330
All right. Let's train 
your level-headedness.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.920
So, what do you think...

18:41.920 --> 18:44.350
now that you've spent some time here?

18:44.350 --> 18:45.680
What do you mean what do I think?

18:46.200 --> 18:49.680
Cecilia always seems relaxed,

18:49.680 --> 18:53.940
but I have the impression that Lawrence is 
always busy with work and household chores.

18:53.940 --> 18:56.500
And yet, he seems to be enjoying himself,

18:56.500 --> 18:59.070
and the villagers adore him.

18:59.070 --> 19:02.190
Your friend certainly is quite the ideal.

19:02.190 --> 19:05.240
Though, he is incredibly dense.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.830
Fatally so, right?

19:06.830 --> 19:07.990
I admit,

19:07.990 --> 19:12.120
I've had fun watching your awkward 
interactions with Saint Cecilia, Miss.

19:12.620 --> 19:14.260
You know that I couldn't help it!

19:14.260 --> 19:17.680
I've hardly ever spoken 
to a girl my own age!

19:19.550 --> 19:21.930
Don't laugh!

19:23.300 --> 19:26.230
Lawren, what's that box?

19:26.230 --> 19:27.180
Oh.

19:27.180 --> 19:30.830
While I was sorting the storeroom, 
I found something nostalgic.

19:30.830 --> 19:32.880
"Something nostalgic"?

19:32.880 --> 19:34.440
What could it be?

19:40.180 --> 19:41.970
Both of you!

19:42.940 --> 19:44.700
Look at this!

19:44.700 --> 19:47.440
C-Cecilia, what is that?

19:47.440 --> 19:49.710
Isn't it just adorable?

19:49.710 --> 19:51.120
What? Adorable?

19:51.120 --> 19:54.720
Given that this is Cecilia, 
she's probably saying that instinctively.

19:54.720 --> 19:56.950
I made this!

19:56.950 --> 20:00.380
It was when I was a student, 
so it was quite a long time ago.

20:08.290 --> 20:12.480
<i>Today the unpleasant feeling seems 
to be stuck to his back.</i>

20:13.640 --> 20:15.220
<i>I guess I have no choice.</i>

20:15.220 --> 20:16.180
Hup!

20:19.650 --> 20:21.330
Hey, Abel.

20:21.330 --> 20:23.530
Could you please not startle me like 
that first thing in the morning?

20:23.530 --> 20:26.390
Oh, sorry about that.

20:26.390 --> 20:27.530
Wait.

20:27.530 --> 20:31.160
What are those? Those objects 
that seem born straight from Hell?

20:31.160 --> 20:34.180
What kind of description 
is that? It's very unique.

20:34.180 --> 20:39.190
Grandpa's having an event at the church, 
and I thought we could decorate with these!

20:39.190 --> 20:40.590
I made them!

20:40.590 --> 20:42.430
Adorable, aren't they?

20:43.920 --> 20:48.050
They turned out so cute, 
I wanted to show everyone.

20:48.050 --> 20:49.930
"Cute"?

20:49.930 --> 20:50.830
Yes!

20:50.830 --> 20:53.890
Grandpa told me to make something cute!

20:53.890 --> 20:57.350
Could he have meant dogs 
or cats or something?

20:58.440 --> 21:01.170
But these are just as cute, don't you think?

21:01.170 --> 21:03.320
Where does that confidence come from?

21:03.600 --> 21:07.560
And so, the truth is, they aren't very cute.

21:07.560 --> 21:08.580
What?!

21:08.580 --> 21:10.300
Don't tell me that now!

21:10.300 --> 21:12.680
But, the lady saint said they were adorable.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.160
Didn't you, Lady Saint?

21:14.160 --> 21:16.680
S-So adorable.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.720
You see?

21:17.720 --> 21:18.210
No.

21:18.210 --> 21:21.800
Just now, Saint Cecilia's words 
were referring to something else.

21:21.800 --> 21:23.440
I see.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.680
There's no need to feel depressed.

21:25.680 --> 21:29.920
Let's try to think of a way that might allow 
the two of them to accept these as cute!

21:29.920 --> 21:32.180
Lady Saint.

21:32.180 --> 21:34.710
What if we added even more cuteness to them?

21:34.710 --> 21:37.440
I see. A cat motif?

21:37.440 --> 21:40.160
Yes! There is nothing cuter than a cat!

21:38.020 --> 21:43.030
They're both dense, and they way they 
never quite click is sort of reassuring.

21:40.160 --> 21:43.480
That's true! Though, 
they won't let me touch them.

21:43.030 --> 21:46.080
You sort of get numb to it 
after a while, though.

21:45.250 --> 21:48.030
But as long as it makes 
these cuter, it's all right!

23:18.490 --> 23:20.000
Hey, Lawrence?

23:20.000 --> 23:22.800
What is this dark stuff dripped all over?

23:23.370 --> 23:24.750
Silly Abel.

23:24.750 --> 23:27.500
It's obvious that it's chocolate, isn't it?

23:27.500 --> 23:30.130
I'm glad you could tell, Lady Saint!

23:30.130 --> 23:33.920
You like to make sweets, Lawren. 
That gave me a hint.

23:30.440 --> 23:32.630
If you stay here long enough,

23:32.630 --> 23:35.520
do you start developing 
the same sensibilities as Lawrence?

23:33.920 --> 23:35.520
You're exactly right.

23:35.520 --> 23:39.400
I thought that dripping chocolate 
over them would make them even cuter!

23:35.520 --> 23:39.400
Then we should probably 
leave as soon as we can.

23:39.400 --> 23:41.400

